For high-throughput ordered logging, implement per-thread submission queues with a single consumer thread that preserves order while allowing parallel I/O preparation.

## Why This Is Asked

Tests understanding of IRQ-safe producer-consumer in a tiny kernel.

## Key Concepts

- IRQ-safe synchronization
- Ring buffer wraparound
- Blocking vs non-blocking reads
